Bekantan: *looks at Sira expectingly*
Sira: (This is Melati. She's a bekantan.)
if {feeding_animals} == true:
	Sira: (Melati loves to swim with Jitendra.)
	Sira: (She's a great swimmer and would often pull us from the river to avoid crocodiles despite her shy nature.)
	Sira: (She sometimes strays into our long house and panics whenever she can't get out again.)
	Sira: (I wonder if she was trying to find Jitendra in there.)
	- Feed Bekantan.
		[signal arg="animal_fed"]
		*Melati jumps happily*
		audio "res://asset/sound/crunch.mp3"
		*She pushes its her nose to the side while eating the unriped food*
	- Later.
		Sira: I'll feed her later.